    "title_zh": "认知发展与取得的组合解释",
    "title_en": "Cognitive development and acquired compositional interpretation",
    "claim_zh": "实际记录形成组合操作并进入他人的重构与传递；取得的分节现接通由多次歧义接触形成的绑定，再进入新组合使用。范围内任意序列对应、实际支持与参考正确性分开；错误唯一绑定、矛盾暂停及误排来源保留。完整认知、学习与演化心理目标继续。",
    "claim_en": "Actual records form compositional operations and enter others’ reconstruction and transmission. Acquired grouping now joins bindings learned across ambiguous encounters and subsequent compositional use. All-sequence correspondence within scope, support and reference correctness remain distinct; wrong unique bindings, suspension and mistaken source exclusion remain. The full cognitive/evolutionary objective continues.",
    "scope_zh": "取得25项定理／52项审计；构造37／65；传递27／45；分节23／51；绑定新增23／41，最新247项继承审计分列。分类、已有操作、场景覆盖、交集规则及来源判断给定。新成果记录单独维护；下一连接是身体与社会活动形成实际可取得的场景，完整注意、心理、演化对应及意识未完成。",
    "scope_en": "Acquisition: 25 theorems / 52 audits; formation: 37 / 65; transmission: 27 / 45; grouping: 23 / 51; binding adds 23 / 41, with 247 inherited audits separately rebuilt. Categories, existing operations, scene coverage, intersection rule and source judgments remain supplied. Canonical records maintain the claims. Next: bodily/social formation of accessible scenes; broad attention, psychology, evolutionary correspondence and consciousness remain incomplete.",
